    description: "Declare a Protocol class (AnalyzerProtocol) in packages/hypergumbo-core that names every method + attribute a language analyzer must provide: analyze(), pass_version, supported_extensions, etc. Refactor each hypergumbo-lang-* analyzer to structurally fulfill the protocol (no inheritance required). mypy + pyright catch any analyzer that drifts. Closes some INV-jahiv analyzer-parity sub-cases (declared Symbol/Edge fields populated unevenly across languages) at type-check time — protocol requires the methods exist with correct signatures even if the runtime population coverage requires a separate property test."  # 4648
