  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. At dev 100b6fbb6e there is no AnalyzerProtocol. Analyzers are @register_analyzer functions typed AnalyzerFunc = Callable[..., AnalysisResult] (registry.py:63), in two call shapes (repo_root[, max_files], by supports_max_files), plus 105 TreeSitterAnalyzer subclasses. The description's analyze()/pass_version/supported_extensions attributes do not exist; the real scope is a callable Protocol replacing Callable[...]. MECHANISM: analyzer callable typed Callable[..., AnalysisResult], so mypy cannot check its signature. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-fofud,WI-kobot,INV-zogud."  # fd28
